# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/caucci2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: CHGNet v0.3.0 (registry model, used for the bulk of
# the MD), the distributed CHGNet-r2SCAN model, and CHGNet-tuned
# (CHGNet-r2SCAN fine-tuned on the authors' r2SCAN dataset of binary
# rare-earth oxides, rare-earth metals and RE-HEOs with f-valence
# electrons). Benchmarks are volume and formation-enthalpy MAEs against
# experiment (properties); diffusion coefficients, conductivities and
# activation energies are properties. No energy/force error metrics.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
